  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On the eve of 18 April 2022, two fire incidents caused havoc in the two villages (Rajab Ali Rind, Tahsil Khairpur Nathan Shah and Faiz Mohammad Chandio Tahsil Mehar) of Dadu district. The magnitude of the fire was intense in village Faiz Mohammad Chandio which took several lives (5 Women and 4 Kids), burned animals, houses, food and other assets.</narrative>
  </description>
